<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>빌드업 | 공부를 위한 성장 플랫폼</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="빌드업은 목표를 세우고, 계획을 관리하며, 꾸준히 성장하는 학습 경험을 제공합니다."
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #f5f7ff;
        --panel: #ffffff;
        --panel-2: #eef3ff;
        --primary: #4f46e5;
        --primary-dark: #312e81;
        --accent: #22c55e;
        --text: #111827;
        --muted: #6b7280;
        --line: #e5e7eb;
        --shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.12);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", "D2Coding", sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8faff 0%, #eef4ff 100%);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
      }

      img {
        max-width: 100%;
        display: block;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .topbar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 20;
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(229, 231, 235, 0.8);
      }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        height: 74px;
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }

      .brand-group {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .brand-link {
        border: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: inherit;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .page-view {
        display: none;
      }

      .page-view.active {
        display: block;
        animation: pageReveal 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
      }

      @keyframes pageReveal {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(12px);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
      }

      .next-page-hero {
        padding: 82px 0 58px;
      }

      .next-page-content {
        max-width: 760px;
      }

      .next-page-content h1 {
        margin: 18px 0;
      }

      .next-page-content > p {
        max-width: 620px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .school-subject-page {
        min-height: calc(100vh - 74px);
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 72px 0 64px;
      }

      .school-subject-page-content {
        width: min(900px, calc(100% - 32px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .school-subject-list {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
        width: min(1120px, 100%);
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .school-subject-link {
        position: relative;
        min-height: 156px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
        color: var(--text);
        font: inherit;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-align: left;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition:
          transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
          color 0.2s ease,
          border-color 0.2s ease,
          box-shadow 0.25s ease,
          background 0.25s ease;
      }

      .school-subject-link::before {
        content: attr(data-subject-number);
        display: grid;
        width: 34px;
        height: 34px;
        place-items: center;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1);
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .school-subject-link::after {
        content: "↗";
        position: absolute;
        right: 16px;
        top: 16px;
        color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.45);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        transition: transform 0.25s ease;
      }

      .school-subject-link:hover,
      .school-subject-link:focus-visible {
        border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.45);
        box-shadow: 0 16px 30px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.12);
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        color: var(--primary);
        outline: none;
      }

      .school-subject-link:hover::after,
      .school-subject-link:focus-visible::after {
        transform: translate(3px, -3px);
      }

      .school-subject-link.active {
        border-color: var(--primary);
        color: var(--primary);
        background: linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          rgba(238, 243, 255, 0.98),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82)
        );
        box-shadow: 0 18px 34px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.16);
      }

      .school-subject-link:nth-child(1) {
        --subject-color: #e11d48;
        --subject-tint: #fff1f2;
      }

      .school-subject-link:nth-child(2) {
        --subject-color: #2563eb;
        --subject-tint: #eff6ff;
      }

      .school-subject-link:nth-child(3) {
        --subject-color: #7c3aed;
        --subject-tint: #f5f3ff;
      }

      .school-subject-link:nth-child(4) {
        --subject-color: #059669;
        --subject-tint: #ecfdf5;
      }

      .school-subject-link:nth-child(5) {
        --subject-color: #d97706;
        --subject-tint: #fffbeb;
      }

      .school-subject-link:nth-child(6) {
        --subject-color: #0891b2;
        --subject-tint: #ecfeff;
      }

      .school-subject-link::before {
        background: var(--subject-tint);
        color: var(--subject-color);
      }

      .school-subject-link:hover,
      .school-subject-link:focus-visible,
      .school-subject-link.active {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--subject-color) 48%, white);
        color: var(--subject-color);
        background: linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          var(--subject-tint),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88)
        );
      }

      .school-subject-link::after {
        color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--subject-color) 58%, white);
      }

      .school-subject-link strong {
        display: block;
        margin-top: auto;
        font-size: 1.18rem;
      }

      .school-subject-link span {
        margin-top: 5px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .school-grade-section {
        margin-top: 26px;
      }

      .school-grade-title {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .school-grade-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .school-grade-link {
        min-width: 58px;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
        color: var(--muted);
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: 0.2s ease;
      }

      .school-grade-link:hover,
      .school-grade-link:focus-visible,
      .school-grade-link.active {
        border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.35);
        background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1);
        color: var(--primary);
        outline: none;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .school-resource-content {
        margin-top: 42px;
        padding-top: 30px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        animation: panelReveal 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
      }

      .school-resource-heading h2 {
        margin: 14px 0 8px;
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
      }

      .school-resource-heading p {
        max-width: 640px;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      .school-resource-body {
        min-height: 180px;
        padding: 22px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
        animation: panelReveal 0.35s ease both;
      }

      .school-resource-body h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        color: var(--primary-dark);
      }

      .school-resource-body p {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      .school-resource-body ul {
        display: grid;
        gap: 10px;
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 20px;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .school-resource-empty {
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .next-page-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
        margin-top: 34px;
      }

      .school-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .resource-school-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .resource-subject-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
        margin: 0 0 34px;
      }

      .resource-subject-grid[hidden] {
        display: none;
      }

      .resource-mode-panel.active {
        animation: panelReveal 0.45s 0.08s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)
          both;
      }

      @keyframes panelReveal {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(14px);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
      }

      .school-square {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .school-square::after {
        position: absolute;
        right: 22px;
        bottom: 18px;
        font-size: 2.4rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        opacity: 0.1;
        transition:
          transform 0.25s ease,
          opacity 0.25s ease;
      }

      .school-square:hover::after {
        opacity: 0.25;
      }

      .school-square[data-school="middle"] {
        border-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.28);
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(240, 253, 244, 0.96),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82)
        );
      }

      .school-square[data-school="middle"]::after {
        content: "M";
        color: #16a34a;
      }

      .school-square[data-school="middle"]:hover::after {
        transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-8deg);
      }

      .school-square[data-school="high"] {
        border-color: rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.28);
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(255, 247, 237, 0.96),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82)
        );
      }

      .school-square[data-school="high"]::after {
        content: "H";
        color: #ea580c;
      }

      .school-square[data-school="high"]:hover::after {
        transform: translateX(-6px) rotate(8deg);
      }

      .school-square[data-school="elementary"] {
        border-color: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.3);
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(240, 249, 255, 0.96),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82)
        );
      }

      .school-square[data-school="elementary"]::after {
        content: "E";
        color: #0284c7;
      }

      .school-square[data-school="elementary"]:hover::after {
        transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.08);
      }

      .school-square[data-school="university"] {
        border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(245, 243, 255, 0.96),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82)
        );
      }

      .school-square[data-school="university"]::after {
        content: "U";
        color: #7c3aed;
      }

      .school-square[data-school="university"]:hover::after {
        transform: translateX(-6px) scale(1.08);
      }

      .resource-school-square[data-resource-school="elementary"] {
        border-color: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.3);
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(240, 249, 255, 0.96),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82)
        );
      }

      .resource-school-square[data-resource-school="middle"] {
        border-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.28);
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(240, 253, 244, 0.96),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82)
        );
      }

      .resource-school-square[data-resource-school="high"] {
        border-color: rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.28);
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(255, 247, 237, 0.96),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82)
        );
      }

      .resource-school-square[data-resource-school="university"] {
        border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(245, 243, 255, 0.96),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82)
        );
      }

      .resource-subject-square:nth-child(1) {
        border-color: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.3);
        background: rgba(240, 249, 255, 0.9);
      }

      .resource-subject-square:nth-child(2) {
        border-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.28);
        background: rgba(240, 253, 244, 0.9);
      }

      .resource-subject-square:nth-child(3) {
        border-color: rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.28);
        background: rgba(255, 247, 237, 0.9);
      }

      .resource-subject-square:nth-child(4) {
        border-color: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.3);
        background: rgba(240, 253, 250, 0.9);
      }

      .resource-subject-square:nth-child(5) {
        border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.32);
        background: rgba(255, 251, 235, 0.9);
      }

      .resource-subject-square:nth-child(6) {
        border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
        background: rgba(245, 243, 255, 0.9);
      }

      .subject-level-title {
        margin: 38px 0 0;
        font-size: 1.35rem;
      }

      .subject-level-description {
        margin: 8px 0 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .subject-level-grid[hidden] {
        display: none;
      }

      .subject-level-grid.school-middle .subject-level-title {
        color: #15803d;
      }

      .subject-level-grid.school-high .subject-level-title {
        color: #c2410c;
      }

      .subject-level-grid.school-elementary .subject-level-title {
        color: #0284c7;
      }

      .subject-level-grid.school-university .subject-level-title {
        color: #0f766e;
      }

      .subject-level-grid.school-middle .level-subject-square {
        animation: middleSubjectIn 0.45s both;
      }

      .subject-level-grid.school-high .level-subject-square {
        animation: highSubjectIn 0.45s both;
      }

      .subject-level-grid.school-elementary .level-subject-square {
        animation: elementarySubjectIn 0.45s both;
      }

      .subject-level-grid.school-university .level-subject-square {
        animation: universitySubjectIn 0.45s both;
      }

      .subject-level-grid .level-subject-square:nth-child(2) {
        animation-delay: 0.04s;
      }
      .subject-level-grid .level-subject-square:nth-child(3) {
        animation-delay: 0.08s;
      }
      .subject-level-grid .level-subject-square:nth-child(4) {
        animation-delay: 0.12s;
      }
      .subject-level-grid .level-subject-square:nth-child(5) {
        animation-delay: 0.16s;
      }
      .subject-level-grid .level-subject-square:nth-child(6) {
        animation-delay: 0.2s;
      }

      @keyframes middleSubjectIn {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(18px);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
      }

      @keyframes highSubjectIn {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateX(18px);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateX(0);
        }
      }

      @keyframes elementarySubjectIn {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: scale(0.92);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: scale(1);
        }
      }

      @keyframes universitySubjectIn {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(-18px);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
      }

      .subject-square {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        min-height: 170px;
        padding: 22px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
        color: var(--text);
        text-align: left;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition:
          transform 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
          border-color 0.28s ease,
          box-shadow 0.28s ease;
      }

      .subject-square:hover {
        border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.45);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        transform: translateY(-4px);
      }

      .subject-square strong {
        display: block;
        margin: 24px 0 8px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }

      .subject-square span:last-child {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
      }

      .subject-number {
        display: grid;
        width: 34px;
        height: 34px;
        place-items: center;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1);
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .subject-page-content {
        max-width: 820px;
      }

      .subject-page-content h1 {
        margin: 18px 0;
      }

      .subject-page-content > p {
        max-width: 620px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .subject-checklist {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 14px;
        margin-top: 34px;
      }

      .subject-checklist div {
        padding: 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .subject-checklist strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .subject-knowledge {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 14px;
        margin-top: 14px;
      }

      .knowledge-card {
        min-height: 150px;
        padding: 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
      }

      .knowledge-card strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: var(--primary-dark);
      }

      .knowledge-card span {
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.65;
      }

      .subject-page-controls {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 36px;
      }

      .subject-page-controls .btn {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
      }

      .resource-mode-panel {
        display: none;
        margin-top: 34px;
      }

      .resource-mode-panel.active {
        display: block;
      }

      .resource-panel-heading {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .resource-panel-heading h2 {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        font-size: 1.55rem;
      }

      .resource-panel-heading p {
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .summary-overview {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .summary-card {
        min-height: 150px;
        padding: 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      }

      .summary-card strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: var(--primary-dark);
      }

      .summary-card p {
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .summary-keywords {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: 12px;
      }

      .summary-keywords span {
        padding: 6px 9px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .summary-checklist {
        display: grid;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 16px;
      }

      .summary-checklist label {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .summary-checklist input {
        margin-top: 4px;
        accent-color: var(--primary);
      }

      .lecture-form {
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      }

      .lecture-form input,
      .lecture-comment-form input {
        width: 100%;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        outline: none;
        background: white;
        font: inherit;
      }

      .lecture-form input:focus,
      .lecture-comment-form input:focus {
        border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.5);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);
      }

      .lecture-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .lecture-card {
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      }

      .lecture-video {
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
        border: 0;
        background: #111827;
      }

      .lecture-card-body {
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .lecture-card-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .lecture-card-header h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.08rem;
      }

      .lecture-card-header time {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
      }

      .lecture-comment-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 8px;
        margin: 14px 0;
      }

      .lecture-comment {
        padding: 10px 12px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: rgba(238, 243, 255, 0.6);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .lecture-comment-form {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .lecture-comment-form .btn {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
      }

      .subject-page-content p {
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .contact-page-content {
        max-width: 900px;
      }

      .community-page-content {
        max-width: 960px;
      }

      .community-page-content h1 {
        margin: 18px 0;
      }

      .community-page-content > p {
        max-width: 650px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .community-toolbar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
        margin: 30px 0 18px;
      }

      .community-form {
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        padding: 20px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      }

      .community-form input,
      .community-form textarea,
      .community-comment-form input {
        width: 100%;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        outline: none;
        background: white;
        font: inherit;
      }

      .community-form textarea {
        min-height: 110px;
        resize: vertical;
      }

      .community-form input:focus,
      .community-form textarea:focus,
      .community-comment-form input:focus {
        border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.5);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);
      }

      .community-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .community-card {
        padding: 22px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        animation: panelReveal 0.4s ease both;
      }

      .community-card-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .community-card h2 {
        margin: 0 0 6px;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
      }

      .community-meta {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
      }

      .community-body {
        margin: 16px 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.8;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
      }

      .community-comments {
        display: grid;
        gap: 8px;
        margin: 16px 0;
      }

      .community-comment {
        padding: 11px 13px;
        border-left: 3px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.25);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(238, 243, 255, 0.55);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .community-comment-form {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .community-comment-form .btn {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
      }

      .shop-page-content {
        max-width: 1040px;
      }

      .shop-toolbar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
        margin: 28px 0 20px;
      }

      .shop-points {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.18);
        color: var(--primary-dark);
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .shop-wallet-label {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 3px;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .shop-filters {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .shop-filter {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 9px 14px;
        background: white;
        color: var(--muted);
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .shop-filter.active,
      .shop-filter:hover {
        border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.35);
        background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);
        color: var(--primary);
      }

      .shop-mode-tabs {
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
        margin: 28px 0 22px;
      }

      .shop-mode-tab {
        border: 1px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.18);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 13px 20px;
        background: rgba(238, 243, 255, 0.72);
        color: var(--primary-dark);
        font: inherit;
        font-weight: 800;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: 0.25s ease;
      }

      .shop-mode-tab:hover,
      .shop-mode-tab.active {
        border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.45);
        background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.14);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.12);
        color: var(--primary);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .shop-mode-panel[hidden] {
        display: none;
      }

      .shop-layout {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 280px;
        gap: 20px;
        align-items: start;
      }

      .shop-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .shop-section-title {
        margin: 30px 0 14px;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
      }

      .shop-currency-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }

      .shop-currency-card {
        --currency-tint: #f5f3ff;
        --currency-color: #4f46e5;
        position: relative;
        padding: 18px;
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--currency-color) 20%, white);
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--currency-tint), #ffffff);
        transition: 0.25s ease;
      }

      .shop-currency-card:nth-child(2) {
        --currency-tint: #eff6ff;
        --currency-color: #2563eb;
      }

      .shop-currency-card:nth-child(3) {
        --currency-tint: #ecfdf5;
        --currency-color: #059669;
      }

      .shop-currency-card:hover {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--currency-color) 48%, white);
        box-shadow: 0 14px 28px color-mix(in srgb, var(--currency-color) 14%, transparent);
        transform: translateY(-4px);
      }

      .shop-currency-card strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        color: var(--primary-dark);
      }

      .shop-currency-card p {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.86rem;
      }

      .shop-product {
        --product-tint: #f5f3ff;
        --product-color: #4f46e5;
        display: flex;
        min-height: 230px;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 20px;
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--product-color) 18%, white);
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--product-tint), #ffffff);
        transition: 0.25s ease;
      }

      .shop-product:hover {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--product-color) 48%, white);
        box-shadow: 0 16px 32px color-mix(in srgb, var(--product-color) 16%, transparent);
        transform: translateY(-4px);
      }

      .shop-product:nth-child(2) {
        --product-tint: #eff6ff;
        --product-color: #2563eb;
      }

      .shop-product:nth-child(3) {
        --product-tint: #ecfdf5;
        --product-color: #059669;
      }

      .shop-product:nth-child(4) {
        --product-tint: #fff7ed;
        --product-color: #ea580c;
      }

      .shop-product:nth-child(5) {
        --product-tint: #fdf2f8;
        --product-color: #db2777;
      }

      .shop-product.product-ad {
        --product-tint: #fef2f2;
        --product-color: #dc2626;
      }

      .shop-product.product-lecture {
        --product-tint: #eff6ff;
        --product-color: #2563eb;
      }

      .shop-product.product-download {
        --product-tint: #ecfdf5;
        --product-color: #059669;
      }

      .shop-product.product-summary {
        --product-tint: #f5f3ff;
        --product-color: #7c3aed;
      }

      .shop-product.product-focus {
        --product-tint: #fff7ed;
        --product-color: #ea580c;
      }

      .shop-product-icon {
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        place-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--product-color) 12%, white);
        color: var(--product-color);
        font-size: 1.45rem;
      }

      .shop-product-icon.double-x {
        border: 2px solid #dc2626;
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: #dc2626;
        font-size: 0;
      }

      .shop-product-icon.double-x::before,
      .shop-product-icon.double-x::after {
        content: "×";
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        width: 4px;
        height: 30px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #dc2626;
        font-size: 0;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(45deg);
      }

      .shop-product-icon.double-x::after {
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-45deg);
      }

      .shop-product-icon.single-slash {
        border: 2px solid #dc2626;
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: #dc2626;
        font-size: 0;
      }

      .shop-product-icon.single-slash::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        width: 4px;
        height: 30px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #dc2626;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(45deg);
      }

      .shop-product-icon.ad-free-logo {
        border: 2px solid #dc2626;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fff1f2, #ffffff);
        color: #dc2626;
        font-size: 0;
      }

      .shop-product-icon.ad-free-logo::before {
        content: "AD";
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      }

      .shop-product-icon.ad-free-logo::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        width: 4px;
        height: 34px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #dc2626;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(45deg);
      }

      .shop-product h2 {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        font-size: 1.08rem;
      }

      .shop-product p {
        min-height: 48px;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .shop-product-footer {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: auto;
      }

      .shop-price {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .shop-product .shop-add-button,
      .shop-currency-card .shop-buy-currency {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--product-color, var(--primary)) 24%, white);
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--product-color, var(--primary)) 10%, white);
        color: var(--product-color, var(--primary-dark));
      }

      .shop-product .shop-add-button:hover,
      .shop-currency-card .shop-buy-currency:hover {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--product-color, var(--primary)) 48%, white);
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--product-color, var(--primary)) 16%, white);
        color: var(--product-color, var(--primary));
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .shop-currency-card .shop-buy-currency {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--currency-color) 24%, white);
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--currency-color) 10%, white);
        color: var(--currency-color);
      }

      .shop-currency-card .shop-buy-currency:hover {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--currency-color) 48%, white);
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--currency-color) 16%, white);
        color: var(--currency-color);
      }

      .shop-price {
        color: var(--primary-dark);
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .shop-cart {
        position: sticky;
        top: 94px;
        padding: 20px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
        box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
      }

      .shop-cart h2 {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
      }

      .shop-cart-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .shop-cart-item {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 8px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.86rem;
      }

      .shop-cart-total {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding-top: 14px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .shop-entitlement {
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding: 14px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.08);
        color: #166534;
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .contact-page-content h1 {
        margin: 18px 0;
      }

      .contact-toolbar,
      .post-form,
      .post-card,
      .comment-box {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      }

      .contact-toolbar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
        margin: 28px 0 18px;
        padding: 18px 20px;
      }

      .auth-status {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .post-form {
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .post-form input,
      .post-form textarea,
      .comment-form input,
      .comment-form textarea {
        width: 100%;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        outline: none;
        background: white;
        font: inherit;
      }

      .post-form textarea,
      .comment-form textarea {
        min-height: 100px;
        resize: vertical;
      }

      .post-form input:focus,
      .post-form textarea:focus,
      .comment-form input:focus,
      .comment-form textarea:focus {
        border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.5);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);
      }

      .post-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .post-card {
        padding: 22px;
      }

      .post-header,
      .comment-header,
      .post-actions,
      .comment-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .post-card h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
      }

      .post-meta,
      .comment-meta {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
      }

      .post-body {
        margin: 14px 0 18px;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.75;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
      }

      .text-button {
        border: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .text-button.danger {
        color: #dc2626;
      }

      .comment-box {
        margin-top: 16px;
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .comment-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
        margin: 14px 0;
      }

      .comment {
        padding: 12px;
        border-left: 3px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);
        background: rgba(238, 243, 255, 0.55);
      }

      .comment.reply {
        margin-top: 10px;
        margin-left: 24px;
        border-left-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4);
      }

      .comment-body {
        margin: 8px 0;
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.6;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
      }

      .comment-form {
        display: grid;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: 12px;
      }

      .comment-form textarea {
        min-height: 70px;
      }

      .inline-error {
        margin: 8px 0 0;
        color: #dc2626;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }

      .page-controls {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 36px;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #7c3aed);
        color: white;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 28px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover {
        color: var(--primary);
      }

      .nav-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .btn {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        height: 46px;
        padding: 0 20px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        transition:
          transform 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
          box-shadow 0.22s ease,
          background 0.22s ease;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .btn:active,
      .subject-square:active,
      .school-subject-link:active {
        transform: scale(0.96) translateY(1px);
      }

      .btn:focus-visible,
      .subject-square:focus-visible,
      .school-subject-link:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.26);
        outline-offset: 4px;
      }

      .click-ripple {
        position: absolute;
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        pointer-events: none;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0);
        animation: clickRipple 0.62s ease-out forwards;
      }

      .btn-secondary .click-ripple,
      .subject-square .click-ripple,
      .school-subject-link .click-ripple {
        background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.18);
      }

      @keyframes clickRipple {
        to {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(16);
        }
      }

      .button-pulse {
        animation: buttonPulse 0.42s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
      }

      @keyframes buttonPulse {
        0% {
          box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.28);
        }
        55% {
          box-shadow: 0 0 0 9px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0);
        }
        100% {
          box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(79, 70, 229, 0);
        }
      }

      .btn-primary {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #7c3aed);
        color: white;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.28);
      }

      .btn-primary:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }

      .btn-secondary {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 72px 0 40px;
      }

      .hero-inner {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 48px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);
        color: var(--primary);
        border: 1px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1);
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 18px 0 16px;
        font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 4vw, 5rem);
        line-height: 1.05;
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }

      .hero p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        max-width: 560px;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 14px;
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .hero-metrics {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 28px;
        margin-top: 30px;
      }

      .metric {
        min-width: 120px;
      }

      .metric strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 2rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      }

      .metric span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      .hero-card {
        background: linear-gradient(
          180deg,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96),
          rgba(238, 243, 255, 0.96)
        );
        border: 1px solid rgba(229, 231, 235, 0.9);
        border-radius: 28px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .dashboard {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #101827 0%, #12294a 100%);
        border-radius: 22px;
        padding: 24px;
        color: white;
      }

      .dashboard-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .stat-pill {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        padding: 6px 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: #dbeafe;
      }

      .chart {
        height: 210px;
        background: linear-gradient(
          180deg,
          rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2),
          rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1)
        );
        border-radius: 16px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      }

      .chart svg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
      }

      .chart-summary {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-top: 18px;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .mini-card {
        flex: 1;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 14px 12px;
      }

      .mini-card strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        margin-top: 4px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 48px 0;
      }

      .section-head {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: end;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 26px;
      }

      .section-head h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      }

      .section-head p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        max-width: 520px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .about-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .about-card {
        min-height: 210px;
        padding: 24px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 22px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
        box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      }

      .about-card strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        color: var(--primary-dark);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .about-card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .feature-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .feature-card {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 22px;
        padding: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      }

      .icon {
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.12),
          rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.12)
        );
      }

      .feature-card h3 {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
      }

      .feature-card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .roadmap {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .step {
        position: relative;
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 22px;
        padding: 22px 20px 20px;
      }

      .step-number {
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #7c3aed);
        color: white;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .step h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .step p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      .cta {
        padding: 64px 0 80px;
      }

      .cta-box {
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          var(--primary-dark),
          var(--primary)
        );
        color: white;
        border-radius: 28px;
        padding: 42px 32px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 20px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .cta-box h3 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      }

      .cta-box p {
        margin: 0;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 20px 0 60px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .footer-inner {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding-top: 22px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .modal {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 20px;
        z-index: 100;
      }

      .modal.open {
        display: flex;
      }

      .modal-panel {
        width: min(420px, 100%);
        background: var(--panel);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 28px 24px 22px;
        box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2);
      }

      .modal-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .modal-header h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }

      .close-btn {
        width: 34px;
        height: 34px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: #f3f4f6;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .login-form {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .login-form label {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .login-form input {
        height: 48px;
        padding: 0 14px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 1rem;
        outline: none;
      }

      .login-form input:focus {
        border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.5);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);
      }

      .input-wrap {
        position: relative;
      }

      .input-wrap input {
        width: 100%;
        padding-right: 84px;
      }

      .input-action {
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        right: 10px;
        transform: translateY(-50%);
        border: 0;
        padding: 5px 6px;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--primary);
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .field-hint {
        margin: -2px 0 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .auth-progress {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .auth-progress.active {
        display: flex;
      }

      .auth-progress::before {
        content: "";
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        border: 2px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);
        border-top-color: var(--primary);
        border-radius: 50%;
        animation: authSpin 0.7s linear infinite;
      }

      @keyframes authSpin {
        to {
          transform: rotate(360deg);
        }
      }

      .reset-panel {
        display: none;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .reset-panel.active {
        display: grid;
      }

      .reset-panel p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .back-to-login {
        border: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--primary);
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .form-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .form-row a {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .message {
        min-height: 22px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #dc2626;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .message.success {
        color: #15803d;
      }

      .social-login {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 4px;
      }

      .social-btn {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        height: 46px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: white;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text);
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .social-btn.google {
        border-color: #e5e7eb;
      }

      .social-btn.naver {
        background: #03c75a;
        border-color: #03c75a;
        color: white;
      }

      .divider {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin: 12px 0 4px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }

      .divider::before,
      .divider::after {
        content: "";
        flex: 1;
        height: 1px;
        background: var(--line);
      }

      .register-wrap {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-top: 14px;
      }

      .register-btn {
        width: 100%;
        height: 46px;
        border: 1px solid var(--primary);
        background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.06);
        color: var(--primary);
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .nav-signup {
        border: 1px solid var(--primary);
        background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.06);
        color: var(--primary);
      }

      .signup-modal-panel {
        width: min(420px, 100%);
      }

      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .hero-inner,
        .feature-grid,
        .next-page-grid,
        .resource-subject-grid,
        .about-grid,
        .subject-checklist,
        .subject-knowledge,
          .summary-overview,
          .shop-layout,
          .shop-grid,
          .shop-currency-grid,
        .cta-box {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          display: grid;
        }

        .school-subject-list {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }

        .shop-layout {
          display: grid;
        }

        .nav-links {
          display: none;
        }

        .cta-box {
          display: grid;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .nav {
          height: auto;
          padding: 18px 0;
        }

        .nav-actions {
          gap: 8px;
        }

        .btn {
          height: 42px;
          padding: 0 16px;
          font-size: 0.92rem;
        }

        .hero {
          padding-top: 48px;
        }

        .hero-actions,
        .hero-metrics {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .school-subject-list {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          width: min(360px, 100%);
        }

        .shop-toolbar {
          align-items: flex-start;
          flex-direction: column;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        html {
          scroll-behavior: auto;
        }

        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
          animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
          animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
          scroll-behavior: auto !important;
          transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="container nav">
        <div class="brand-group">
          <button
            type="button"
            class="brand brand-link home-link"
            aria-label="빌드업 홈"
          >
            <span class="brand-mark">B</span>
            <span>빌드업</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="메인 메뉴">
          <a href="#next" class="learning-space-link">요약정리</a>
          <a href="#lectures" class="lecture-space-link">강의</a>
          <a href="#materials" class="materials-space-link">공부자료</a>
          <a href="#community" class="community-space-link">커뮤니티</a>
          <a href="#shop" class="shop-space-link">상점</a>
          <a href="#contact">문의</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="nav-actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary open-login">
            로그인
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="btn nav-signup open-signup">
            회원가입
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="top" class="page-view active">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-inner">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">✓ 꾸준한 성장의 시작</span>
            <h1>
              공부를 <span style="color: var(--primary)">기록하고</span>,
              성장하고, 이어가세요.
            </h1>
            <p>
              빌드업은 계획을 세우고, 실천을 관리하며, 매일 조금씩 쌓이는 성취를
              시각적으로 보여주는 학습 플랫폼입니다. 목표를 이루는 과정이 더
              즐겁고 체계적으로 바뀝니다.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary open-login">
                무료로 시작하기
              </button>
              <a href="#features" class="btn btn-secondary">기능 보기</a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-metrics" aria-label="성장 통계">
              <div class="metric">
                <strong id="metricActiveLearners">12k+</strong>
                <span>활성 학습자</span>
              </div>
              <div class="metric">
                <strong id="metricGoalRate">92%</strong>
                <span>목표 달성률</span>
              </div>
              <div class="metric">
                <strong id="metricFocusGain">3.4배</strong>
                <span>학습 집중도 향상</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-card" aria-label="학습 대시보드 미리보기">
            <div class="dashboard">
              <div class="dashboard-header">
                <strong id="dashboardTitle">이번 주 학습 리포트</strong>
                <span class="stat-pill" id="dashboardTrend">+18% 상승</span>
              </div>

              <div class="chart">
                <svg
                  viewBox="0 0 400 200"
                  preserveAspectRatio="none"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <defs>
                    <linearGradient id="lineGradient" x1="0" x2="1">
                      <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#8b5cf6" />
                      <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#34d399" />
                    </linearGradient>
                  </defs>
                  <path
                    d="M0,170 C40,145, 80,88, 120,104 S200,90, 240,52 S310,22, 400,42 L400,200 L0,200 Z"
                    fill="rgba(139,92,246,0.25)"
                  />
                  <path
                    d="M0,170 C40,145, 80,88, 120,104 S200,90, 240,52 S310,22, 400,42"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="url(#lineGradient)"
                    stroke-width="4"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                  />
                </svg>
              </div>

              <div class="chart-summary">
                <div class="mini-card">
                  <span>학습 시간</span>
                  <strong id="dashboardHours">8.6h</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="mini-card">
                  <span>완료율</span>
                  <strong id="dashboardCompletion">86%</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="mini-card">
                  <span>연속일수</span>
                  <strong id="dashboardStreak">19일</strong>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="features">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2>성장에 필요한 기능만 담았습니다.</h2>
            <p>
              학습 계획부터 실행 관리, 성과 분석까지 필요한 모든 흐름을 한
              곳에서 깔끔하게 정리합니다.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-grid">
            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="icon">📚</div>
              <h3>맞춤형 학습 계획</h3>
              <p>
                목표에 맞는 단계별 계획을 세우고, 매일의 학습량을 균형 있게
                관리할 수 있습니다.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="icon">✅</div>
              <h3>실천형 체크리스트</h3>
              <p>
                해야 할 일과 오늘의 루틴을 시각적으로 확인해, 작은 행동들이 쌓여
                큰 성장을 만듭니다.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="icon">📈</div>
              <h3>성장 데이터 분석</h3>
              <p>
                학습 시간, 완성도, 연속 기록을 한눈에 보며, 무엇이 효과적인지
                점점 더 정확하게 파악합니다.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="roadmap">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2>작은 습관이 큰 변화를 만듭니다.</h2>
            <p>
              처음부터 완벽하게 시작할 필요는 없습니다. 매일 한 단계씩 쌓아가면
              됩니다.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="roadmap">
            <article class="step">
              <div class="step-number">1</div>
              <h3>목표를 정하세요</h3>
              <p>
                어떤 분야를 배우고 싶은지, 얼마나 꾸준히 하고 싶은지 명확하게
                정리합니다.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="step">
              <div class="step-number">2</div>
              <h3>일정을 설계하세요</h3>
              <p>
                주간 루틴과 학습 단위를 나누어 부담 없이 관리할 수 있도록
                구조화합니다.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="step">
              <div class="step-number">3</div>
              <h3>꾸준히 이어가세요</h3>
              <p>
                기록과 피드백을 통해 성취감을 느끼며, 자연스럽게 공부 습관을
                확장해 나갑니다.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="about">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2>당신의 학습 여정을 더 단단하게.</h2>
            <p>
              빌드업은 공부할 내용을 정리하는 데서 끝나지 않습니다. 목표를
              세우고, 오늘 할 일을 실천하고, 배운 내용을 돌아보는 과정을 하나의
              흐름으로 연결해 자기주도적인 학습 습관을 만들어줍니다.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="about-grid">
            <article class="about-card">
              <strong>학습을 시작하는 방법</strong>
              <p>
                먼저 자신의 학교급과 과목을 선택해 필요한 학습 공간으로
                이동하세요. 현재 수준에 맞는 내용을 확인한 뒤, 오늘의 목표를
                작게 정하면 부담 없이 공부를 시작할 수 있습니다.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="about-card">
              <strong>꾸준함을 만드는 기록</strong>
              <p>
                학습 시간과 완료한 내용을 기록하면 노력의 흐름이 눈에 보입니다.
                작은 성취를 매일 확인하면서 자신에게 맞는 속도와 공부 습관을
                찾아갈 수 있습니다.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="about-card">
              <strong>성장을 이어가는 경험</strong>
              <p>
                한 번에 모든 것을 완벽하게 하려고 하지 않아도 됩니다. 배운
                내용을 복습하고 부족한 부분을 다시 채우며, 어제보다 나아진
                오늘을 차곡차곡 만들어 보세요.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cta" id="contact">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="cta-box">
            <div>
              <h3>궁금하신 사항은 언제든 편하게 문의해 주시기 바랍니다.</h3>
              <p>문의사항을 게시해 주시면 최대한 빠르게 답변해 드리겠습니다.</p>
            </div>
            <button
              type="button"
              class="btn btn-secondary open-contact"
              style="
                background: white;
                color: var(--primary-dark);
                border: none;
